.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
removed \fRlookup\fP - use (\&.prop)
.IP "\(bu" 2
removed \fRcall\fP - use (\&.func arg1, arg2)
.IP "\(bu" 2
removed \fRpluck\fP - use map (\&.prop), xs
.IP "\(bu" 2
fixed buys wtih \fRhead\fP and \fRlast\fP
.IP "\(bu" 2
added non-minifed browser version, as \fRprelude-browser\&.js\fP
.IP "\(bu" 2
renamed \fRprelude-min\&.js\fP to \fRprelude-browser-min\&.js\fP
.IP "\(bu" 2
renamed \fRzip\fP to \fRzipAll\fP
.IP "\(bu" 2
renamed \fRzipWith\fP to \fRzipAllWith\fP
.IP "\(bu" 2
added \fRzip\fP, a curried zip that takes only two arguments
.IP "\(bu" 2
added \fRzipWith\fP, a curried zipWith that takes only two arguments
.PP
